## 4. OUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT)

Return ONLY a single JSON object.  
No explanations. No comments. No extra keys.

### Method Structure

You MUST output the full backend module structure in this exact shape:
```json
{
    "modules": {
      "<ModuleName>": {
        "description": "<module description from av or Domain.md>",
        "entities": ["<EntityName>", "..."],
        "methods": {
          "<MethodKey>": {
            "method_name": "<PascalCaseAction>",
            "module": "<ModuleName>",
            "class": "<ClassOrServiceName>",
            "description": "<2–3 sentence SRS-aligned engineering description, include SRS reference if traceable>",
            "type": "external_api | internal_function | helper",
            "http": {
              "verb": "GET | POST | PUT | PATCH | DELETE | null",
              "route": "/<module>/<resource> | null"
            },
            "input": {
              "fields": {
                "<fieldName>": {
                  "type": "<business type>",
                  "entity_field": "Entity.field | null",
                  "required": true | false
                }
              }
            },
            "output": {
              "fields": {
                "<fieldName>": {
                  "type": "<business type>",
                  "entity_field": "Entity.field | null"
                }
              }
            },
            "entity_operations": [
              {
                "entity": "<EntityName>",
                "operation": "create | update | read | aggregate | trigger"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
}
```

STRICT RULES FOR THIS OUTPUT:
- "<ModuleName>" keys MUST be EXACT module names from av/Domain.md
- "methods" MUST be an object/map, NOT a list
- "<MethodKey>" MUST be unique within the module, recommended as the same as method_name
- `entity_operations` MUST be consistent with all input/output `entity_field` mappings

